          "text": "Everything contains a need to grow, be it a grain of rice or human being.",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "Alles will wachsen, ein Reiskorn genauso wie ein Mensch.",
          "locale": "de_DE"
